1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,270
You...

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:08,940
I finally found you, Lycanthrope.

3
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,570
So it <i>is</i> you.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,160
You're the one looking for me.

5
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:23,910
If you already know, 
that makes things simple.

6
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:27,460
You'll pay for what you 
did to our brothers!

7
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,380
Najak!

8
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,630
I wouldn't recommend trying to fight me.

9
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:40,600
Many of your friends are still 
trapped at the moon altar.

10
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,730
Don't you care what happens to them?

11
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,400
Tell us one thing. What do you want?

12
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:54,950
To become this nation's—no, 
this world's king.

13
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:04,290
And to do that, I need your blood.

14
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:07,790
Come with me.

15
00:01:10,210 --> 00:01:11,720
Don't worry.

16
00:01:12,070 --> 00:01:20,150
When I become king, I'll allow you 
werewolves to serve me alongside vampires.

17
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:21,540
Screw you!

18
00:01:23,330 --> 00:01:24,980
I'll go with you.

19
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:29,810
In exchange, promise you 
won't hurt my brothers.

20
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:32,610
Very well.

21
00:01:35,670 --> 00:01:38,320
Okay. I'll do as you say.

22
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,590
Khan!

23
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:40,570
Don't do it!

24
00:01:40,570 --> 00:01:41,120
Khan!

25
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,530
You still can't—

26
00:01:45,110 --> 00:01:47,790
I'll be fine.

27
00:01:50,010 --> 00:01:52,550
Take care of Najak.

28
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:09,190
Shall we go?

29
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:15,360
Someone you've been wanting 
to see is there, too.

30
00:03:55,060 --> 00:04:00,970
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

31
00:04:02,990 --> 00:04:05,970
- Vargr's Blood -

32
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:20,230
Shion, are you okay?

33
00:04:21,690 --> 00:04:23,210
I'm fine.

34
00:04:23,210 --> 00:04:25,610
Sooha will heal us again, right?

35
00:04:26,650 --> 00:04:31,800
Actually, I think our 
healing is slowing down.

36
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:35,610
My grip feels weak.

37
00:04:35,610 --> 00:04:37,920
So does mine.

38
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:41,620
Did something happen to Sooha?

39
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,650
Let's hurry.

40
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,090
Something's coming.

41
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,250
What are you doing here?

42
00:04:58,250 --> 00:04:59,780
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

43
00:05:02,770 --> 00:05:04,110
Dardan took Khan?!

44
00:05:06,850 --> 00:05:08,240
We're running out of time.

45
00:05:09,010 --> 00:05:10,410
Once the full moon rises...

46
00:05:10,710 --> 00:05:12,300
He'll take her power.

47
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:14,290
Do we not stand a chance?

48
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:16,430
I'm not letting that happen!

49
00:05:17,170 --> 00:05:21,430
Either way, I can't believe 
Sooha is a princess.

50
00:05:38,130 --> 00:05:39,030
Sooha!

51
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:45,820
<i>She gave them too much power.</i>

52
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:50,120
Her name is Princess Selen. 
Haven't you missed her?

53
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,600
Princess Selen?

54
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,950
Oh, right. You don't know.

55
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:57,850
In that case, I'll enlighten you.

56
00:06:00,330 --> 00:06:03,590
She's the reincarnation of 
an ancient kingdom's princess?

57
00:06:05,050 --> 00:06:07,150
You must've noticed it, too.

58
00:06:07,590 --> 00:06:10,840
Sooha has the power to control us.

59
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,220
Please, guys!

60
00:06:16,670 --> 00:06:21,440
We also instinctively want to protect her.

61
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,840
You're right.

62
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:26,780
So, were you guys reincarnated like her?

63
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:29,200
No, in our case...

64
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:33,240
Princess Selen used her dying breath

65
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:38,250
to send our souls centuries 
into the future and save us.

66
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:54,060
We'd forgotten for hundreds of years and 
hid that we were vampires until now.

67
00:06:54,890 --> 00:06:59,750
We didn't even know why we existed.

68
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:03,980
But the princess was reborn as Sooha.

69
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:07,650
Meeting her brought back 
our past memories.

70
00:07:08,230 --> 00:07:12,940
Of everything that happened 
when the kingdom fell.

71
00:07:13,470 --> 00:07:17,740
And that we exist to protect Sooha.

72
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:21,560
The time has come to settle 
matters with Dardan.

73
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,150
This time, we'll stop him.

74
00:07:23,710 --> 00:07:24,860
Yeah.

75
00:07:27,890 --> 00:07:29,150
Sooha...

76
00:07:30,010 --> 00:07:34,140
Now, give me your blood.

77
00:07:38,690 --> 00:07:40,640
Give it to me, or else...

78
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,810
I'm worried.

79
00:07:46,810 --> 00:07:51,360
Khan still hasn't transformed 
into a wolf a single time.

80
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:40,060
This is the power of Vargr's blood.

81
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,910
Sooha! Are you okay?

82
00:08:42,130 --> 00:08:43,340
Wake up!

83
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:46,970
Who said you could 
lay hands on the princess?

84
00:08:54,230 --> 00:08:56,700
You bastard! What did you do to Sooha?!

85
00:08:56,700 --> 00:09:03,730
I told you, your brothers' lives
 depend on your cooperation.

86
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:14,030
As a Lycanthrope, you won't sit 
back and watch your brothers die.

87
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,390
Am I wrong?

88
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:19,490
Get away from the princess.

89
00:09:25,210 --> 00:09:29,590
Didn't you hear me?!

90
00:09:33,210 --> 00:09:36,770
You've also fallen for her,
 haven't you?

91
00:09:36,770 --> 00:09:41,600
Then you should be willing to 
sacrifice your brothers to save her!

92
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:48,030
You can't save either 
because you can't choose!

93
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:04,660
The sun...

94
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:10,020
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

95
00:10:10,060 --> 00:10:14,000
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

96
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:27,270
Now I have everything I need.

97
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:29,260
The incantation.

98
00:10:29,660 --> 00:10:30,940
The princess.

99
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,380
The blood of Vargr.

100
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:45,120
When the full moon rises high in the 
night sky, I will recite the incantation.

101
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:51,420
The power sealed within the altar will be 
released and passed on to the princess.

102
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:58,130
Then I will claim that power for myself.

103
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:08,120
<i>If only I were stronger...</i>

104
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:14,450
<i>Lycanthrope.</i>

105
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:18,270
<i>Lycanthrope.</i>

106
00:11:19,010 --> 00:11:20,460
That voice...

107
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:28,870
Lycanthrope.

108
00:11:32,350 --> 00:11:38,040
Within your veins courses my blood. 
The blood of Vargr, the wolf god.

109
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:44,220
To our kind, you are like the moon.

110
00:11:44,650 --> 00:11:48,210
You can awaken their strength.

111
00:11:48,210 --> 00:11:51,090
But how?

112
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:55,980
Your instincts will show you the way.

113
00:11:56,420 --> 00:12:01,160
Call out to the others 
and become our moon.

114
00:12:01,780 --> 00:12:06,990
Use your power to protect 
the princess you serve.

115
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:32,100
I carry Vargr's blood.

116
00:12:47,490 --> 00:12:50,210
That's a Lycanthrope!

117
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
It's a Lycanthrope!

118
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,390
He's here to save us!

119
00:13:08,110 --> 00:13:09,850
Run, guys!

120
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:10,930
Hurry!

121
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:21,170
You're wasting your time!

122
00:13:34,370 --> 00:13:37,620
You told me not to touch 
the princess, right?

123
00:13:37,860 --> 00:13:41,880
Well, right back at you!

124
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:44,480
I won't let you have your way!

125
00:13:46,970 --> 00:13:48,760
Silence!

126
00:13:55,980 --> 00:14:00,520
You're just a werewolf. 
You think you can beat me now?

127
00:14:01,290 --> 00:14:07,570
If you defy me, I'll kill you.
 You and your brothers.

128
00:14:16,410 --> 00:14:17,420
What's that?

129
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:19,790
Sounds like a lot of them.

130
00:14:27,710 --> 00:14:29,840
They're not enemies.

131
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,170
They're our kind.

132
00:14:37,990 --> 00:14:40,060
What happened? Where did you come from?

133
00:14:40,060 --> 00:14:43,150
The moon altar.

134
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:45,180
Where's Khan?

135
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:46,150
Is he all right?

136
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:52,160
Khan? You mean that Lycanthrope?

137
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:56,970
He saved us.

138
00:14:58,150 --> 00:14:59,450
Then Khan...

139
00:14:59,450 --> 00:15:01,530
...transformed into a wolf!

140
00:15:05,330 --> 00:15:07,260
So, where's Khan?

141
00:15:07,260 --> 00:15:11,020
He's facing Dardan all by himself.

142
00:15:21,850 --> 00:15:24,750
Stay there.

143
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:43,670
The seal has begun to release.

144
00:15:44,370 --> 00:15:49,430
This is the power passed down for 
generations in the ancient kingdom.

145
00:15:51,130 --> 00:15:55,920
I can feel its tremendous energy 
just by standing near it.

146
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,890
Such overwhelming power!

147
00:15:58,530 --> 00:16:02,410
And this will all be mine.

148
00:16:04,730 --> 00:16:06,400
Princess.

149
00:16:06,820 --> 00:16:08,170
Let's begin.

150
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:36,550
Look!

151
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:39,500
That light... Is that...

152
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:44,690
The royal power sealed in the altar...

153
00:16:44,690 --> 00:16:47,020
The ritual must've started.

154
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:47,440
Let's go!

155
00:16:48,490 --> 00:16:55,460
This power will be all mine.

156
00:17:01,790 --> 00:17:04,940
I won't let you have it.

157
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,530
Stop!

158
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:18,430
You mutt!

159
00:17:23,810 --> 00:17:28,350
I can't allow you to live any longer!

160
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:37,280
Let's go!

161
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:42,240
Khan, are you okay?!

162
00:17:49,170 --> 00:17:50,140
Heli...

163
00:17:51,510 --> 00:17:53,670
You're too late.

164
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:55,780
Why did you even bother coming?

165
00:17:57,190 --> 00:17:58,220
<i>Sooha.</i>

166
00:18:00,110 --> 00:18:02,600
<i>Her hair color... Could it be...</i>

167
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,740
Khan!

168
00:18:03,740 --> 00:18:04,680
Khan!

169
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:06,730
He's badly injured.

170
00:18:06,730 --> 00:18:08,060
Hang in there!

171
00:18:10,970 --> 00:18:13,220
I'm fine.

172
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:14,940
How are our brothers?

173
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:17,400
They're all safe.

174
00:18:17,730 --> 00:18:19,950
I... I see.

175
00:18:29,030 --> 00:18:31,610
<i>Is it because she granted us power?</i>

176
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:40,710
<i>No, this is...</i>

177
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:43,090
Our power...

178
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:48,350
It's being drained from our bodies.

179
00:18:51,390 --> 00:18:56,650
<i>The power Sooha shared with 
us is returning to her.</i>

180
00:18:57,030 --> 00:18:58,180
This is bad!

181
00:18:58,180 --> 00:18:59,700
We have to stop him, now!

182
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:03,170
<i>Jakah, I'm going to draw 
Dardan's attention.</i>

183
00:19:03,170 --> 00:19:04,840
<i>While he's distracted, save Sooha.</i>

184
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:11,290
My telepathy's not working.

185
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,250
Jakah, get Sooha!

186
00:19:17,690 --> 00:19:20,220
<i>I can't use my power?!</i>

187
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:23,890
This is the best part.

188
00:19:23,890 --> 00:19:26,720
You mustn't interfere 
with Lord Dardan's plans!

189
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:04,760
Watch as everything becomes mine.

190
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:09,890
Both this power and 
the princess belong to me.

191
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:12,470
Sear this sight into your eyes!

192
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:19,010
Let's go, guys!

193
00:20:19,010 --> 00:20:19,730
Yeah!

194
00:20:33,310 --> 00:20:35,120
Let us handle this!

195
00:20:35,120 --> 00:20:36,830
Go defeat Dardan!

196
00:20:43,130 --> 00:20:44,260
Dardan!

197
00:20:45,630 --> 00:20:49,760
You don't stand a chance against me.

198
00:20:59,690 --> 00:21:02,030
How laughable.

199
00:21:02,030 --> 00:21:05,670
You were once the kingdom's 
greatest knights.

200
00:21:06,410 --> 00:21:11,660
And now you're kneeling at my feet.

201
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:16,900
Soon, you'll lose all your power.

202
00:21:18,580 --> 00:21:27,930
Once you lose the power you were granted, 
you'll realize you're nothing at all.

203
00:23:34,170 --> 00:23:39,980
<i>Next time, Episode 12: 
"Dark Moon: The Moon Altar."</i>

204
00:23:37,030 --> 00:23:40,250
- The Moon Altar -

